WEBVTT

00:12:29.160 --> 00:12:31.521
by somebody who's thought a lot about changes

00:12:31.521 --> 00:12:33.849
in concepts and changes in technology.

00:12:33.849 --> 00:12:36.113
"We always overestimate the change that will occur

00:12:36.113 --> 00:12:38.336
in the next two years and underestimate

00:12:38.336 --> 00:12:42.212
the change that will occur in the next 10." -- Bill Gates.

00:12:42.212 --> 00:12:43.575
Thanks very much.

00:12:43.575 --> 00:12:46.258
(Applause)